<title>USA: Ashland names Paul Chellgren CEO.</title>
<headline>Ashland names Paul Chellgren CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ASHLAND, Ky. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashland Inc said Thursday its board of directors had named Paul Chellgren as the company's chief executive officer effective October 1, the start of its fiscal year.</p>
